---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Shell from '../../components/shell/Shell.astro';
import PageHead from '../../components/shell/PageHead.astro';
import Explain from '../../components/shell/Explain.astro';
---
<Base title="Agent | SKUdesk" description="What the agent does, the checks every result passes and what it cannot do."><Shell>
<PageHead title="Agent" sub="What it does, how it is checked and what it cannot do."><span slot="badge" class="pill" id="state">…</span></PageHead>
<Explain>
One agent, one job: find the cheapest landed cost, price a resale and look for arbitrage, <b>only for the identical product</b>. It works for a human who sets its limits and decides every spend.
</Explain>
<div class="grid2 start">
<section class="card" aria-labelledby="do-h"><h2 id="do-h">What it does</h2>
<ol class="steps-list">
<li><b>Searches</b> Google Shopping (and eBay when configured), with every paid call cached and capped.</li>
<li><b>Judges identity</b> with Gemini: each listing against your product, quoting the brand and set number it relied on.</li>
<li><b>Verifies the quotes</b> in code. No quote, no match; errors count as "uncertain".</li>
<li><b>Refuses bad data</b>: prices far below the median or the recalled retail price are set aside.</li>
<li><b>Works out the money</b> in integer cents: landed cost, fees, shipping, margin floor.</li>
<li><b>Files a proposal</b> for a person to approve. It never spends.</li>
</ol></section>
<section class="card" aria-labelledby="no-h"><h2 id="no-h">What it cannot do</h2>
<ul class="steps-list">
<li>Spend money or hold payment details.</li>
<li>Approve its own proposals, or anyone else's.</li>
<li>Exceed the owner's per-buy limit, or act while paused.</li>
<li>Pass a listing it cannot back with a quote from the listing's own text.</li>
<li>Follow instructions hidden inside a listing; listing text is treated as untrusted data.</li>
</ul></section>
</div>
<section class="card" aria-labelledby="now-h"><h2 id="now-h">Its latest reasoning</h2><div id="latest"><p class="muted sm">Loading…</p></div></section>
<section class="card" aria-labelledby="lim-h"><h2 id="lim-h">Current limits</h2><div id="limits"></div></section>
</Shell></Base>
<script>
  import { api, h, money, pct } from '../../lib/client.ts';
  Promise.all([api('/api/limits'), api('/api/analyses?n=1')]).then(async ([lim, rows]) => {
    const st = document.getElementById('state')!;
    st.textContent = lim.paused ? 'paused' : 'active'; st.className = `pill ${lim.paused ? 'bad' : 'good'}`;
    document.getElementById('limits')!.replaceChildren(h('table', { class: 'kv' }, h('tbody', {}, h('tr', {}, h('td', {}, 'Per-buy limit'), h('td', {}, money(lim.maxSpendCents))), h('tr', {}, h('td', {}, 'Margin floor'), h('td', {}, pct(lim.minMarginBps))), h('tr', {}, h('td', {}, 'Kill switch'), h('td', {}, lim.paused ? 'ON, agent paused' : 'off')))), h('p', { class: 'muted sm' }, 'Changed on the Limits page by the owner.'));
    const latest = document.getElementById('latest')!;
    if (!rows.length) { latest.replaceChildren(h('p', { class: 'muted sm' }, 'No check yet.')); return; }
    const a = await api(`/api/analyses/${rows[0].id}`);
    latest.replaceChildren(h('p', {}, h('b', {}, a.query), ' · ', new Date(a.createdAt).toLocaleString()), h('p', { class: 'v-text' }, a.headline), a.briefing ? h('p', { class: 'muted' }, a.briefing) : null, h('p', {}, h('a', { href: `/show/?id=${a.id}` }, 'Replay this check →')));
  }).catch(() => {});
</script>
<style>
.steps-list{margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:grid;gap:var(--s3);color:var(--mut)}
.steps-list b{color:var(--txt)}
.v-text{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:var(--fs-2xl);line-height:1.2}
</style>
